  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&apos;s Thatre Center</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Children&apos;s Theatre Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program som syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja barnteaterverksamhet p&#xe5; Balkan som ett konstn&#xe4;rligt och pedagogiskt redskap i str&#xe4;van att &#xf6;verbrygga kulturanimositet. Programmet best&#xe5;r av olika aktiviter bl workshops f&#xf6;r pj&#xe4;sf&#xf6;rfattare och direkt barnteaterverksamhet med barn av olika etniska bakgrund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to promote Children&apos;s Theatre as an artistic, educational and social tool in dealing with issues that have to do with family, education, interethnic contacts and understanding. The programme includes activities such as playwrights workshops and direct thatre work with children belonging to different ethnicity groups.</narrative>
  </description>
